{"3389240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "《蜀山：初章》正式版", "steam_appid": 3389240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>游戏简介</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《蜀山：初章》是首款基于UE5引擎打造的大世界修仙多人在线游戏。故事以还珠楼主的《蜀山剑侠传》为大背景，采用了无缝大地图模式。地图上，玩家可以御剑飞行，自由探索各种奇遇。真实还原修仙体验</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1.回归初心：献给30岁、40岁的你我，回归20年前端游玩法“千年、天堂、奇迹、剑侠、热血江湖等等。</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/7c75957d2ab4320cc569991fbf815c6e.avif?t=1740627702\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras_big/7c75957d2ab4320cc569991fbf815c6e.avif?t=1740627702 width=800 height=368 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1）野外称霸、自由开团</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/5e52e508c6d9e696ccf463434ac29179.poster.avif?t=1740627702\" width=618 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/5e52e508c6d9e696ccf463434ac29179.webm?t=1740627702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2）个人洞府、三千世界、自由刷装</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >无限探索：玩家可以在诸多大世界中自由探索，无需 遵循严格的剧情线路或特定的路线。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/80222cdb9eeedc5ec97c243eba3d3cf3.avif?t=1740627702\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras_big/80222cdb9eeedc5ec97c243eba3d3cf3.avif?t=1740627702 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/a4285fec09eeeee15c3d0e705dc8d4af.avif?t=1740627702\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras_big/a4285fec09eeeee15c3d0e705dc8d4af.avif?t=1740627702 width=800 height=482 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3）PVE玩法、野外世界首领争夺</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >世界首领争夺是基于队伍的PVE玩法</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BOSS掉落：装备、铜币，高阶BOSS掉落稀有法宝、材料</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/e14e7f1d9b827d938c17ae00ee867f7b.avif?t=1740627702\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras_big/e14e7f1d9b827d938c17ae00ee867f7b.avif?t=1740627702 width=800 height=482 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/27498b8ebb974ca6f197d9da196424a1.avif?t=1740627702\" width=754 height=420 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4）PVE玩法、野外首领地宫争夺</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >地宫入口、BOSS可以PK争夺</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/894b5fed389b664b36b3f0884397d79b.avif?t=1740627702\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras_big/894b5fed389b664b36b3f0884397d79b.avif?t=1740627702 width=800 height=501 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5）PVE玩法、大团本九华山</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >团队副本最高12人，副本难度：探索、困难、噩梦、神惧分别对应不同的修仙境界</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >玩法奖励：有几率获得对应秘境境界的红色/橙色品质装备、功元金丹、功元散、护灵蟾、灵魄石、银锭、绑铜</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/073974f431409a0e0905eb11b2045776.avif?t=1740627702\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras_big/073974f431409a0e0905eb11b2045776.avif?t=1740627702 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/dcb15d913972958d9d7422935358e596.avif?t=1740627702\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras_big/dcb15d913972958d9d7422935358e596.avif?t=1740627702 width=800 height=362 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6）PVE玩法、单人狩猎</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >参与方式：全天开放，每日2次。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >玩法奖励：红色/橙色品质装备、功元金丹、功元散、护灵蟾、灵魄石、银锭、绑铜</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/2e688177b15882559153c82e5445d053.avif?t=1740627702\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras_big/2e688177b15882559153c82e5445d053.avif?t=1740627702 width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/afac28f76ac8550b18798546630e8319.avif?t=1740627702\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras_big/afac28f76ac8550b18798546630e8319.avif?t=1740627702 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7）PVE玩法、守卫山门</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >守卫山门是以宗族为单位的大型PVE玩法，可多达数百人跨服参与：周1~周3每晚19:00</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >活动奖励：怪物掉落稀有装备和法宝，造成伤害的玩家均可参与竞拍</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/80c9b4fa81cdc4461ec5b75d6c346814.avif?t=1740627702\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras_big/80c9b4fa81cdc4461ec5b75d6c346814.avif?t=1740627702 width=800 height=444 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/95956bd79628328400c9e5fdcb8e9411.avif?t=1740627702\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras_big/95956bd79628328400c9e5fdcb8e9411.avif?t=1740627702 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8）PVE玩法、仙陨遗迹</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >上古修真者陨落之地，诸多功法传承都是出自此处；屠魔点是进入遗迹的唯一条件；</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >遗迹开放时间每天早上9：00-凌晨2：00；</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >掉落:遗迹内小怪以及首领是灵魄石、护灵蟾的唯一产出;遗迹boss掉落所有功法总决和残卷</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/62b907671e44636120e5aa011d87f2a6.avif?t=1740627702\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras_big/62b907671e44636120e5aa011d87f2a6.avif?t=1740627702 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9）PVP玩法、跨服领地战</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >百族逐鹿是以宗族为单位的大型跨服PVP玩法,获胜方宗族在接下来的一周内将额外获得大量宗族资源。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >报名时间：周1~周4;开赛时间：周5~周7每晚20:00</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >获胜方式：野外夺旗、城镇推塔</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >活动奖励：铜币、宗族贡献、巅峰积分</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/15592b40bb5bbd37fdbda3b01fbaad89.avif?t=1740627702\" width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10）PVE玩法、诛魔&amp;魔将初伐</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>诛魔：</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >玩家可以在诛魔界面完成当前阶段推荐进行的杀怪任务，也可以主动前往击杀首领。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >诛魔成长线分为多个节点，每个阶段有相匹配的包装名字、任务内容、奖励内容。完成系统推送的杀怪目标任务后，可以在界面领取相应奖励。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/f9182d845fdb7a81b4ce6902746ebb2d.avif?t=1740627702\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras_big/f9182d845fdb7a81b4ce6902746ebb2d.avif?t=1740627702 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>魔将初伐：</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >各个大世界族群BOSS的全服首杀玩家，将会被记录展示在魔将初伐界面，并且全服玩家都可以领取世界奖励。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >（为了避免产出公平性问题，我们没有设置首杀玩家的单人奖励），提升首杀玩家玩家荣誉感</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >且每个玩家在第一次杀死各个族群BOSS时，还可以领取独属于自己的个人首杀奖励</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/9fb314a5b17bd9ab9d921b7d9d9ba98b.avif?t=1740627702\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras_big/9fb314a5b17bd9ab9d921b7d9d9ba98b.avif?t=1740627702 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11）PVP玩法、跨服团战</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >诸天征伐是以宗族为单位的赛季制PVP玩法，大量铜币、大量巅峰积分、称号</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >报名时间：周1~周2;开赛时间：周2~周4每晚21:30~22:30</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >获胜方式：联图互推</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >双方自己建造的宗族地图相联,率先攻破对方主殿或最终主殿剩余血量百分比更高的一方获胜</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/982ed0c81b740150819de35bf8b4dfa7.avif?t=1740627702\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras_big/982ed0c81b740150819de35bf8b4dfa7.avif?t=1740627702 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12）PVP玩法、多人PK副本</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >离渊界是高境界的PVP地图，内含海量装备打造材料，是修仙者必争之地。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >玩家可以采集场景中道具，获得各种资源。也可以通过击杀其他玩家，来获得资源道具</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/3ecd8200ae6fde0dda1b34e4ced812a5.avif?t=1740627702\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras_big/3ecd8200ae6fde0dda1b34e4ced812a5.avif?t=1740627702 width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/74cbf4fca7c0e6fd98c887d67171923a.avif?t=1740627702\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras_big/74cbf4fca7c0e6fd98c887d67171923a.avif?t=1740627702 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13）PVP玩法、仙陨屠魔</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >自由PVP玩法，活动区域内刷新大量怪物掉落【屠魔令】；角色死亡或者被击杀，【屠魔令】会掉落</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >上交【屠魔令】可参与本场的上交排名；1-10名可获得大量奖励和屠魔点.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/f855401ccfc3728b11cb682ce99d85b2.avif?t=1740627702\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras_big/f855401ccfc3728b11cb682ce99d85b2.avif?t=1740627702 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14）建造玩法、宗族及位面</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >宗族是玩家间组建的社交群体，成员可以一起下副本挑战BOSS、共建共享宗族的各种福利</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >加入宗族还可以参与诸天征伐PVP等活动</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >建设宗族位面，可升级宗族福利，在宗族商店可以兑换到更多道具</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/8b3698c1e76ea27e63e607f1a85e02de.avif?t=1740627702\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras_big/8b3698c1e76ea27e63e607f1a85e02de.avif?t=1740627702 width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/96a6311a310b7a595922eb3bae7f3f05.avif?t=1740627702\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras_big/96a6311a310b7a595922eb3bae7f3f05.avif?t=1740627702 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2.自由环境：解放环境、时间、人力等限制：自由跨端、数据同步。</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1）可以舒舒服服电脑前畅玩</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2）可以随时随地手机摸鱼</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3）离线也有服务器AI全程托管刷资源！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/47c8dfd474229cb4684bb227a11bc00c.poster.avif?t=1740627702\" width=618 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/47c8dfd474229cb4684bb227a11bc00c.webm?t=1740627702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/47c8dfd474229cb4684bb227a11bc00c.mp4?t=1740627702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3.自由交易：愿意花时间的花时间，愿意氪金的参与自由交易</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1）我们还原了“买断版核心玩法三千世界无限刷刷刷”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2）在此基础上搭建完全自由的交易体系；鼓励零氪，也鼓励搬砖</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a.交易行 b.摆摊 c.组队竞拍、大世界竞拍</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3）放弃商城：所有道具投放到游戏里产出。（官方只保留了战令、交易币和税收的收益）</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/264926145bb02a05cab59e71f0796118.poster.avif?t=1740627702\" width=618 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/264926145bb02a05cab59e71f0796118.webm?t=1740627702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/264926145bb02a05cab59e71f0796118.mp4?t=1740627702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4.开放世界：无缝地图、自由飞行、肉鸽BD、无职业自创流派修仙</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1）无缝地图</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >无缝地图：256平方公里超大地图,场景无缝模式，无加载等待</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >真实世界：真实时辰 + 随机天气系统，体验最真实的修仙世界</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2）自由飞行，海陆空无死角</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >身临其境体验御剑飞行、体验最自由的国风修仙游戏</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/65547768f8b66fd73f2b8f1560be4e78.poster.avif?t=1740627702\" width=618 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/65547768f8b66fd73f2b8f1560be4e78.webm?t=1740627702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3）自由BD、千人千仙</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >数十种词条BD：神兵利器的DIY玩法，相同以及不同词条之间可以激活相应的羁绊；</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >玩家可以对装备进行词条抽取，以获取极品词条</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/07612aa48bc67ffe0c43316f2a102e67.poster.avif?t=1740627702\" width=618 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/07612aa48bc67ffe0c43316f2a102e67.webm?t=1740627702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/07612aa48bc67ffe0c43316f2a102e67.mp4?t=1740627702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4）无职业限制：自创修仙流派</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >不同功法拥有不同的功体效果，从而以之为核心形成自己的修仙体系：如炮台剑修流、风筝游走流、自爆卡车流等等</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/c1a96e47d1766afbcc5cc2fb00e9f4f9.poster.avif?t=1740627702\" width=618 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/c1a96e47d1766afbcc5cc2fb00e9f4f9.webm?t=1740627702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/c1a96e47d1766afbcc5cc2fb00e9f4f9.mp4?t=1740627702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5.真实修仙：取消传统游戏等级、铁三角等概念，还原如同“凡人修仙传”似的真实修仙</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >我们在尝试，如何把国风、中国文化通过RPG这一游戏形式表现出来</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/a9d7b4c3acebe6c90f16dc44e164303c.poster.avif?t=1740627702\" width=618 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/a9d7b4c3acebe6c90f16dc44e164303c.webm?t=1740627702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>未来版本规划：</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >资料片1：南方魔教</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >新增第五个兵器-蛊引及对应可收集的功法技能：</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1）该兵器功法拥有强大的减益及辅助能力。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2）带有召唤技能，可以召唤冰甲蟒、无垢灵兽、土甲龙、金髓晶虫，还可以降低对手防御和攻击等属性</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3）新增独有的蛊灵玩法</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4）新增装备-灵笛。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>资料片2：北海陷空岛</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1）新增专属陷空岛PVP玩法：地图上分布着丰富的资源点，包括仙矿、仙草等。玩家可以争夺这些资源点，以获取丰厚的修炼资源和奖励。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2）新增专属陷空岛PVE玩法：陷空妖兽、陷空秘境、陷空岛试炼等</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3）新增更加开放自由的社交体系</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4）更新核心词条玩法</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>资料片3：道魔之争</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1）新增宗门掌门、长老等职位的竞选产生机制。新增宗门职位对应的功能和玩法，不同职位有不同的加成效果</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2）掌门：宗门的最高领导者，负责宗门整体规划和决策，制定宗门发展战略、领导宗门成员、管理资源分配</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3）长老：宗门的重要决策者，负责协助掌门管理宗门事务。组织宗门内的防务、处置宗门内部纷争</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4）宗门战：宗门领土争夺战，占领领土后可独享宗门BOSS在内的稀缺资源。宗门战涉及到战略部署，包括选择出战的成员、合理利用地形、选择最佳的战术策略等。战略的制定和执行对整个宗门的胜负至关重要。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>资料片4：峨眉斗剑</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1）开放空战：玩家可以驾驭法宝，在云端快速穿梭，躲避敌袭，同时释放技能予以精准打击。空中斗法中，玩家可以释放各种仙术和技能，包括疾行术、御剑闪避、仙风飞舞等，展现修仙者的神奇力量。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2）法宝搭配：每个法宝都有独特属性，对应不同天气不同时辰不同战术，出战和辅助的法宝搭配也各不相同。玩家可以根据技战术需求选择适合自己的法宝搭配。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3）法宝DIY：玩家可以个性化定制自己的法宝，包括外观、法宝技能词条等，展现千人千仙的修仙风采。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4）御剑对决：玩家可以与其他修仙者进行激烈的空中对决，争夺空中资源、领地，并且参加御剑斗法的比武大会。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5）通过御剑斗法，为玩家提供更加多样化、自由化的游戏内容，身临其境的享受开放世界的修仙体验。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>游戏简介</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >《蜀山：初章》是首款基于UE5引擎打造的大世界修仙多人在线游戏。故事以还珠楼主的《蜀山剑侠传》为大背景，采用了无缝大地图模式。地图上，玩家可以御剑飞行，自由探索各种奇遇。真实还原修仙体验</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1.回归初心：献给30岁、40岁的你我，回归20年前端游玩法“千年、天堂、奇迹、剑侠、热血江湖等等。</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/7c75957d2ab4320cc569991fbf815c6e.avif?t=1740627702\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras_big/7c75957d2ab4320cc569991fbf815c6e.avif?t=1740627702 width=800 height=368 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1）野外称霸、自由开团</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/5e52e508c6d9e696ccf463434ac29179.poster.avif?t=1740627702\" width=618 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/5e52e508c6d9e696ccf463434ac29179.webm?t=1740627702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2）个人洞府、三千世界、自由刷装</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >无限探索：玩家可以在诸多大世界中自由探索，无需 遵循严格的剧情线路或特定的路线。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/80222cdb9eeedc5ec97c243eba3d3cf3.avif?t=1740627702\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras_big/80222cdb9eeedc5ec97c243eba3d3cf3.avif?t=1740627702 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/a4285fec09eeeee15c3d0e705dc8d4af.avif?t=1740627702\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras_big/a4285fec09eeeee15c3d0e705dc8d4af.avif?t=1740627702 width=800 height=482 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3）PVE玩法、野外世界首领争夺</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >世界首领争夺是基于队伍的PVE玩法</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BOSS掉落：装备、铜币，高阶BOSS掉落稀有法宝、材料</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/e14e7f1d9b827d938c17ae00ee867f7b.avif?t=1740627702\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras_big/e14e7f1d9b827d938c17ae00ee867f7b.avif?t=1740627702 width=800 height=482 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/27498b8ebb974ca6f197d9da196424a1.avif?t=1740627702\" width=754 height=420 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4）PVE玩法、野外首领地宫争夺</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >地宫入口、BOSS可以PK争夺</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/894b5fed389b664b36b3f0884397d79b.avif?t=1740627702\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras_big/894b5fed389b664b36b3f0884397d79b.avif?t=1740627702 width=800 height=501 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5）PVE玩法、大团本九华山</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >团队副本最高12人，副本难度：探索、困难、噩梦、神惧分别对应不同的修仙境界</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >玩法奖励：有几率获得对应秘境境界的红色/橙色品质装备、功元金丹、功元散、护灵蟾、灵魄石、银锭、绑铜</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/073974f431409a0e0905eb11b2045776.avif?t=1740627702\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras_big/073974f431409a0e0905eb11b2045776.avif?t=1740627702 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/dcb15d913972958d9d7422935358e596.avif?t=1740627702\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras_big/dcb15d913972958d9d7422935358e596.avif?t=1740627702 width=800 height=362 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6）PVE玩法、单人狩猎</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >参与方式：全天开放，每日2次。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >玩法奖励：红色/橙色品质装备、功元金丹、功元散、护灵蟾、灵魄石、银锭、绑铜</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/2e688177b15882559153c82e5445d053.avif?t=1740627702\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras_big/2e688177b15882559153c82e5445d053.avif?t=1740627702 width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/afac28f76ac8550b18798546630e8319.avif?t=1740627702\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras_big/afac28f76ac8550b18798546630e8319.avif?t=1740627702 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7）PVE玩法、守卫山门</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >守卫山门是以宗族为单位的大型PVE玩法，可多达数百人跨服参与：周1~周3每晚19:00</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >活动奖励：怪物掉落稀有装备和法宝，造成伤害的玩家均可参与竞拍</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/80c9b4fa81cdc4461ec5b75d6c346814.avif?t=1740627702\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras_big/80c9b4fa81cdc4461ec5b75d6c346814.avif?t=1740627702 width=800 height=444 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/95956bd79628328400c9e5fdcb8e9411.avif?t=1740627702\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras_big/95956bd79628328400c9e5fdcb8e9411.avif?t=1740627702 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8）PVE玩法、仙陨遗迹</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >上古修真者陨落之地，诸多功法传承都是出自此处；屠魔点是进入遗迹的唯一条件；</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >遗迹开放时间每天早上9：00-凌晨2：00；</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >掉落:遗迹内小怪以及首领是灵魄石、护灵蟾的唯一产出;遗迹boss掉落所有功法总决和残卷</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/62b907671e44636120e5aa011d87f2a6.avif?t=1740627702\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras_big/62b907671e44636120e5aa011d87f2a6.avif?t=1740627702 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9）PVP玩法、跨服领地战</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >百族逐鹿是以宗族为单位的大型跨服PVP玩法,获胜方宗族在接下来的一周内将额外获得大量宗族资源。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >报名时间：周1~周4;开赛时间：周5~周7每晚20:00</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >获胜方式：野外夺旗、城镇推塔</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >活动奖励：铜币、宗族贡献、巅峰积分</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/15592b40bb5bbd37fdbda3b01fbaad89.avif?t=1740627702\" width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10）PVE玩法、诛魔&amp;魔将初伐</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>诛魔：</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >玩家可以在诛魔界面完成当前阶段推荐进行的杀怪任务，也可以主动前往击杀首领。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >诛魔成长线分为多个节点，每个阶段有相匹配的包装名字、任务内容、奖励内容。完成系统推送的杀怪目标任务后，可以在界面领取相应奖励。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/f9182d845fdb7a81b4ce6902746ebb2d.avif?t=1740627702\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras_big/f9182d845fdb7a81b4ce6902746ebb2d.avif?t=1740627702 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>魔将初伐：</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >各个大世界族群BOSS的全服首杀玩家，将会被记录展示在魔将初伐界面，并且全服玩家都可以领取世界奖励。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >（为了避免产出公平性问题，我们没有设置首杀玩家的单人奖励），提升首杀玩家玩家荣誉感</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >且每个玩家在第一次杀死各个族群BOSS时，还可以领取独属于自己的个人首杀奖励</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/9fb314a5b17bd9ab9d921b7d9d9ba98b.avif?t=1740627702\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras_big/9fb314a5b17bd9ab9d921b7d9d9ba98b.avif?t=1740627702 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11）PVP玩法、跨服团战</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >诸天征伐是以宗族为单位的赛季制PVP玩法，大量铜币、大量巅峰积分、称号</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >报名时间：周1~周2;开赛时间：周2~周4每晚21:30~22:30</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >获胜方式：联图互推</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >双方自己建造的宗族地图相联,率先攻破对方主殿或最终主殿剩余血量百分比更高的一方获胜</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/982ed0c81b740150819de35bf8b4dfa7.avif?t=1740627702\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras_big/982ed0c81b740150819de35bf8b4dfa7.avif?t=1740627702 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12）PVP玩法、多人PK副本</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >离渊界是高境界的PVP地图，内含海量装备打造材料，是修仙者必争之地。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >玩家可以采集场景中道具，获得各种资源。也可以通过击杀其他玩家，来获得资源道具</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/3ecd8200ae6fde0dda1b34e4ced812a5.avif?t=1740627702\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras_big/3ecd8200ae6fde0dda1b34e4ced812a5.avif?t=1740627702 width=800 height=448 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/74cbf4fca7c0e6fd98c887d67171923a.avif?t=1740627702\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras_big/74cbf4fca7c0e6fd98c887d67171923a.avif?t=1740627702 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13）PVP玩法、仙陨屠魔</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >自由PVP玩法，活动区域内刷新大量怪物掉落【屠魔令】；角色死亡或者被击杀，【屠魔令】会掉落</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >上交【屠魔令】可参与本场的上交排名；1-10名可获得大量奖励和屠魔点.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/f855401ccfc3728b11cb682ce99d85b2.avif?t=1740627702\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras_big/f855401ccfc3728b11cb682ce99d85b2.avif?t=1740627702 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14）建造玩法、宗族及位面</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >宗族是玩家间组建的社交群体，成员可以一起下副本挑战BOSS、共建共享宗族的各种福利</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >加入宗族还可以参与诸天征伐PVP等活动</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >建设宗族位面，可升级宗族福利，在宗族商店可以兑换到更多道具</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/8b3698c1e76ea27e63e607f1a85e02de.avif?t=1740627702\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras_big/8b3698c1e76ea27e63e607f1a85e02de.avif?t=1740627702 width=800 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/96a6311a310b7a595922eb3bae7f3f05.avif?t=1740627702\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras_big/96a6311a310b7a595922eb3bae7f3f05.avif?t=1740627702 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2.自由环境：解放环境、时间、人力等限制：自由跨端、数据同步。</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1）可以舒舒服服电脑前畅玩</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2）可以随时随地手机摸鱼</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3）离线也有服务器AI全程托管刷资源！</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/47c8dfd474229cb4684bb227a11bc00c.poster.avif?t=1740627702\" width=618 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/47c8dfd474229cb4684bb227a11bc00c.webm?t=1740627702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/47c8dfd474229cb4684bb227a11bc00c.mp4?t=1740627702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3.自由交易：愿意花时间的花时间，愿意氪金的参与自由交易</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1）我们还原了“买断版核心玩法三千世界无限刷刷刷”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2）在此基础上搭建完全自由的交易体系；鼓励零氪，也鼓励搬砖</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >a.交易行 b.摆摊 c.组队竞拍、大世界竞拍</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3）放弃商城：所有道具投放到游戏里产出。（官方只保留了战令、交易币和税收的收益）</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/264926145bb02a05cab59e71f0796118.poster.avif?t=1740627702\" width=618 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/264926145bb02a05cab59e71f0796118.webm?t=1740627702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/264926145bb02a05cab59e71f0796118.mp4?t=1740627702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4.开放世界：无缝地图、自由飞行、肉鸽BD、无职业自创流派修仙</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1）无缝地图</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >无缝地图：256平方公里超大地图,场景无缝模式，无加载等待</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >真实世界：真实时辰 + 随机天气系统，体验最真实的修仙世界</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2）自由飞行，海陆空无死角</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >身临其境体验御剑飞行、体验最自由的国风修仙游戏</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/65547768f8b66fd73f2b8f1560be4e78.poster.avif?t=1740627702\" width=618 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/65547768f8b66fd73f2b8f1560be4e78.webm?t=1740627702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3）自由BD、千人千仙</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >数十种词条BD：神兵利器的DIY玩法，相同以及不同词条之间可以激活相应的羁绊；</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >玩家可以对装备进行词条抽取，以获取极品词条</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/07612aa48bc67ffe0c43316f2a102e67.poster.avif?t=1740627702\" width=618 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/07612aa48bc67ffe0c43316f2a102e67.webm?t=1740627702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/07612aa48bc67ffe0c43316f2a102e67.mp4?t=1740627702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4）无职业限制：自创修仙流派</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >不同功法拥有不同的功体效果，从而以之为核心形成自己的修仙体系：如炮台剑修流、风筝游走流、自爆卡车流等等</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/c1a96e47d1766afbcc5cc2fb00e9f4f9.poster.avif?t=1740627702\" width=618 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/c1a96e47d1766afbcc5cc2fb00e9f4f9.webm?t=1740627702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/c1a96e47d1766afbcc5cc2fb00e9f4f9.mp4?t=1740627702\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5.真实修仙：取消传统游戏等级、铁三角等概念，还原如同“凡人修仙传”似的真实修仙</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >我们在尝试，如何把国风、中国文化通过RPG这一游戏形式表现出来</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/a9d7b4c3acebe6c90f16dc44e164303c.poster.avif?t=1740627702\" width=618 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/extras/a9d7b4c3acebe6c90f16dc44e164303c.webm?t=1740627702\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>未来版本规划：</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >资料片1：南方魔教</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >新增第五个兵器-蛊引及对应可收集的功法技能：</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1）该兵器功法拥有强大的减益及辅助能力。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2）带有召唤技能，可以召唤冰甲蟒、无垢灵兽、土甲龙、金髓晶虫，还可以降低对手防御和攻击等属性</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3）新增独有的蛊灵玩法</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4）新增装备-灵笛。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>资料片2：北海陷空岛</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1）新增专属陷空岛PVP玩法：地图上分布着丰富的资源点，包括仙矿、仙草等。玩家可以争夺这些资源点，以获取丰厚的修炼资源和奖励。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2）新增专属陷空岛PVE玩法：陷空妖兽、陷空秘境、陷空岛试炼等</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3）新增更加开放自由的社交体系</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4）更新核心词条玩法</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>资料片3：道魔之争</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1）新增宗门掌门、长老等职位的竞选产生机制。新增宗门职位对应的功能和玩法，不同职位有不同的加成效果</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2）掌门：宗门的最高领导者，负责宗门整体规划和决策，制定宗门发展战略、领导宗门成员、管理资源分配</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3）长老：宗门的重要决策者，负责协助掌门管理宗门事务。组织宗门内的防务、处置宗门内部纷争</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4）宗门战：宗门领土争夺战，占领领土后可独享宗门BOSS在内的稀缺资源。宗门战涉及到战略部署，包括选择出战的成员、合理利用地形、选择最佳的战术策略等。战略的制定和执行对整个宗门的胜负至关重要。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>资料片4：峨眉斗剑</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1）开放空战：玩家可以驾驭法宝，在云端快速穿梭，躲避敌袭，同时释放技能予以精准打击。空中斗法中，玩家可以释放各种仙术和技能，包括疾行术、御剑闪避、仙风飞舞等，展现修仙者的神奇力量。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2）法宝搭配：每个法宝都有独特属性，对应不同天气不同时辰不同战术，出战和辅助的法宝搭配也各不相同。玩家可以根据技战术需求选择适合自己的法宝搭配。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3）法宝DIY：玩家可以个性化定制自己的法宝，包括外观、法宝技能词条等，展现千人千仙的修仙风采。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4）御剑对决：玩家可以与其他修仙者进行激烈的空中对决，争夺空中资源、领地，并且参加御剑斗法的比武大会。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5）通过御剑斗法，为玩家提供更加多样化、自由化的游戏内容，身临其境的享受开放世界的修仙体验。</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "《蜀山：初章》是首款基于UE5引擎打造的大世界修仙多人在线游戏。故事以还珠楼主的《蜀山剑侠传》为大背景，采用了无缝大地图模式。地图上，玩家可以御剑飞行，自由探索各种奇遇。真实还原修仙体验", "supported_languages": "Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/header.jpg?t=1740627702", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/61c2dfe887d90914f90f2efaface8b2cbbf448a5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740627702", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389240/61c2dfe887d90914f90f2efaface8b2cbbf448a5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740627702", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> windows10/11 64位操作系统<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 7代或同级别处理器<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 6G显存或同级别显卡<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 40 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Direct Sound 兼容之声卡</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> windows10/11 64位操作系统<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 10代或同级别以上处理器<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</stro